# ===== VisionQC project-specific =====

# Raw dataset (too large for Git, versioned with DVC later)
# (Managed by DVC's own .gitignore in data/raw)

# Prepared YOLO dataset (generated — regenerate with scripts/prepare_dataset.py)
data/prepared/

# Model weights and training artifacts (large binaries — use DVC later)
artifacts/
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.pkl
models/*.pt
models/*.pth

# Ultralytics training cache and output
runs/
yolov8n.pt

# MLflow / DVC (future phases)
mlruns/
mlflow.db

# Secrets / environment files
.env
*.env
.env.local

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# Compressed archives
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# reports/ IS committed (contains .md and .json result files from real runs)
# data/prepared/ is NOT committed (always regenerated)
# artifacts/ is NOT committed (too large; use DVC or model registry)
